cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "EvoFlow"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - name: "EvoFlow Contributors"
abstract: >-
  EvoFlow 是一个会自己变好的 LLM Agent 框架：三层进化栈（上下文 / 记忆 / 权重）+
  评估门，用你自己的反馈信号以一杯咖啡的成本持续进化。
  A self-evolving LLM agent framework that gets better from your own feedback
  signals — a three-layer evolution stack (context / memory / weights) gated by
  an Evolution Gate, at coffee-money cost.
